#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:7
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:10
msgid "Troubleshoot a run"
msgstr "排查一次运行"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid ""
"Start from the visible symptom, reduce the graph to the smallest failing "
"path, and separate graph correctness from device and measurement cost."
msgstr "从可见症状开始，将图缩减到最小失败路径，并将图正确性与设备和测量成本分开。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "The application does not start"
msgstr "应用无法启动"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:19
msgid "Activate the expected Python environment."
msgstr "激活预期的 Python 环境。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid "Rebuild stale frontend output with `npm --prefix frontend run build`."
msgstr "使用 `npm --prefix frontend run build` 重新构建过期的前端输出。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:21
msgid "Start on an unused loopback port:"
msgstr "在未使用的回环端口上启动："

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid "Request `http://127.0.0.1:8042/api/health` before opening the workbench."
msgstr "打开工作台前，请请求 `http://127.0.0.1:8042/api/health`。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:29
msgid ""
"If Vite renders but data does not load, confirm that the backend is running "
"and that `COMFYRESEARCH_PORT` matches its port."
msgstr "若 Vite 已渲染但数据未加载，请确认后端正在运行且 `COMFYRESEARCH_PORT` 与其端口一致。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:32
msgid "The Trainer rejects the graph"
msgstr "Trainer 拒绝该图"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:34
msgid "Work upstream from the Trainer:"
msgstr "从 Trainer 向上游排查："

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid "Confirm every required socket has one intended source."
msgstr "确认每个必需 socket 都有一个预期源。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:37
msgid "Check dataset and model dimensions."
msgstr "检查数据集和模型维度。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Check that the loss accepts the model output and target type."
msgstr "检查损失是否接受模型输出和目标类型。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Check batch size against the training set."
msgstr "根据训练集检查批量大小。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:40
msgid "Remove optional schedules and Observables until the core graph validates."
msgstr "移除可选调度器和 Observables，直到核心图通过验证。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:42
msgid ""
"Do not reconnect edges by appearance alone. The source and target handles "
"are part of the executable graph contract."
msgstr "不要仅凭外观重新连接边。源和目标 handle 是可执行图契约的一部分。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:45
msgid "Training is unexpectedly slow or runs out of memory"
msgstr "训练异常缓慢或内存不足"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:47
msgid ""
"switch to CPU for a tiny correctness test or to the intended accelerator for"
" the real workload;"
msgstr "小型正确性测试切换到 CPU，真实工作负载切换到预期加速器；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:49
msgid "increase log frequency to record expensive measurements less often;"
msgstr "提高 log frequency 以降低昂贵测量的记录次数；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:50
msgid "disable Hessian, spectral, representation, or attention Observables;"
msgstr "禁用 Hessian、谱、表征或注意力 Observables；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:51
msgid "reduce model, dataset, and batch size independently;"
msgstr "分别减小模型、数据集和批量大小；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:52
msgid "check whether comma-separated fields expanded into a Cartesian product."
msgstr "检查逗号分隔字段是否扩展为笛卡尔积。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:54
msgid "A visualization is empty"
msgstr "可视化为空"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:56
msgid ""
"Confirm that the run reached a logged step, the Trainer output is connected "
"to the intended visualization, and the Observable has a paired result "
"consumer. An empty chart can be a routing or logging issue even when "
"training completed."
msgstr ""
"确认运行到达了已记录步骤，Trainer 输出已连接到预期可视化，并且 Observable "
"有配套的结果消费者。即使训练已完成，空图表也可能是路由或记录问题。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:60
msgid "Remote execution fails"
msgstr "远程执行失败"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:62
msgid ""
"Verify ordinary SSH access outside the application, then check host, user, "
"remote path, remote Python, and authentication. Use the local CPU graph "
"first. Never paste the contents of `.comfyresearch/remote_train_config.json`"
" into a public report because it may contain a plain-text password."
msgstr ""
"先在应用外验证普通 SSH 访问，然后检查主机、用户、远程路径、远程 Python 和认证。请先使用本地 CPU 图。绝不要将 "
"`.comfyresearch/remote_train_config.json` 的内容粘贴到公开报告中，因为它可能包含明文密码。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/troubleshooting.md:67
msgid "For exact routes and event types, use the [Reference](../reference/index.md)."
msgstr "精确路由和事件类型请参阅[参考](../reference/index.md)。"
